1
00:00:00,481 --> 00:00:05,141
(Sheldon:)...and since Howard and Bernadette are
married, intellectual property in the letter...

2
00:00:05,319 --> 00:00:07,649
(Sheldon:)...is jointly owned by the two spouses?

3
00:00:12,927 --> 00:00:14,797
(Penny:)Yeah, obviously.

4
00:00:16,664 --> 00:00:17,894
(Sheldon:)Well played.

5
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:22,163
(Sheldon:)Sometimes I don't give you
enough credit, Penny.

6
00:00:24,672 --> 00:00:27,902
(Raj:)Dude, you made the right choice
coming to me for help with this party.

7
00:00:28,075 --> 00:00:30,405
(Leonard:)Actually, all I did was invite you.

8
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:33,579
(Raj:)Well, put your mind at ease.

9
00:00:33,747 --> 00:00:37,377
(Raj:)I'm here to make sure your dinner party
kicks Howard's dinner party's ass.

10
00:00:37,551 --> 00:00:40,211
(Raj:)Now, the first thing we need is a theme.

11
00:00:40,387 --> 00:00:44,617
(Raj:)I'm thinking, ah,
turn-of-the-century Moulin Rouge.

12
00:00:47,461 --> 00:00:50,521
(Leonard:)I'm thinking you need a testosterone patch.

13
00:00:52,199 --> 00:00:54,189
Penny and I just wanna
do something low-key.

14
00:00:54,368 --> 00:00:57,128
(Leonard:)You know, cocktails, light jazz music,
hors d'oeuvres.

15
00:00:57,338 --> 00:01:05,028
So your theme is "I saw a rerun of Mad Men
and bought crab puffs from Trader Joe's"?

